# Keep the repository itself in LF on every platform. Without this, a contributor
# with core.autocrlf=true commits CRLF and the diffs become unreadable.
#
# Line endings in the *released* files are a separate matter: the Windows archive
# built by .github/workflows/release.yml converts its text files to CRLF, because
# those are opened in Notepad rather than in an editor that copes with LF. The
# settings parser accepts either (see stripINIDecorations in app/config.go), so this
# is only about how the files look when opened.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated by `templ generate`; keep them out of diffs and language stats.
*_templ.go linguist-generated=true

# Binary assets, never line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
